  "fixture": "K5-controlled-variables-render-deterministically-or-halt",
  "title": "Controlled variables render deterministically, or the call halts",
  "purpose": "Four variables of four types (text, money, whole number, enumerated value), one used twice. Rendering is a pure function of the wording and the facts: one fixed format per type. A value that is missing, has more than two decimals, or is not in the field's list is never defaulted, rounded or skipped — the item is not delivered, the plan is BLOCKED and the run halts.",
